## Add shared graph context/action formatters

Context: Task 1 of Graph Chat MCP alignment — port MCP server class/node
context formatting into shared `graph_formatting` helpers so Graph Chat
agents can render dataset/bridge/action metadata with a parameterized
action-invoke hint (`request_entity_action` vs MCP's `invoke_entity_action`).

Changes:

1. `src/agents/tools/graph_formatting.py`
   Add `format_class_context_block`, `format_node_context_response`,
   `format_node_action_response`; extend `format_find_response` with
   `class_actions` and `action_invoke_hint`.
2. `tests/units/agents/test_graph_formatting_context.py`
   Unit tests for class context blocks, find-response enrichment, and
   node context/action formatters (TDD).

