## Add ToolContext class-actions and pending_action fields

Context: Task 2 of Graph Chat MCP alignment — storage fields on
`ToolContext` and `AgentResult` so later tasks can populate class-action
metadata and surface pending entity-action tokens from the agent loop.

Changes:

1. `src/agents/tools/context.py`
   Add `dtwin_class_actions` and `pending_action` fields to `ToolContext`.
2. `src/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/engine.py`
   Add `pending_action` to `AgentResult`; copy `ctx.pending_action` onto
   the result on success and max-iteration exit paths.
3. `tests/units/agents/test_agent_dtwin_chat_engine.py`
   Unit test asserting default field values and `AgentResult.pending_action`.

